stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING: Work Order Created<br/>(Auto-seeds checklist from Category)

    PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS: Start Work / Mark Checklist Item Started
    PENDING --> CANCELLED: Cancel Order (Admin only)

    IN_PROGRESS --> BLOCKED: Impediment Encountered (Client pending docs)
    BLOCKED --> IN_PROGRESS: Blocker Resolved

    IN_PROGRESS --> REVIEW: All checklist items completed<br/>(or Supervisor Override)
    
    REVIEW --> COMPLETED: Final Supervisor Sign-off
    REVIEW --> IN_PROGRESS: Reopened for Revisions

    IN_PROGRESS --> CANCELLED: Cancelled with Reason
    BLOCKED --> CANCELLED: Cancelled

    COMPLETED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]

    note right of IN_PROGRESS
      Checklist Progress:
      - Drag-and-drop sortable items
      - Position sequence 0, 1, 2...
      - Completion updates progress_percent
      - History logs state delta
    end note

    note right of REVIEW
      Quality Gate:
      Requires 100% checklist completion
      OR Supervisor Override with audit note
    end note
